          "type": "FToolTargetTypeRequirements&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UToolTarget*",
      "docs": "Uses one of the stored factories to build a tool target out of the given input object\nthat satisfies the given requirements. If multiple factories are capable of building a\nqualifying target, the first encountered one will be used. If none are capable, a nullptr\nis returned.\n@return Tool target that staisfies given requirements, or nullptr if none could be created."
    },
